        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+---------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              CROP SYSTEM DIVERSITY SPECTRUM                   |\n|                                                               |\n|  LOW DIVERSITY                          HIGH DIVERSITY        |\n|  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  |\n|  Monoculture → Rotation → Intercrop → Polyculture → Agroforest|\n|                                                               |\n|  MANAGEMENT                                                   |\n|  INTENSITY           HIGH ─────────────────────→ LOW          |\n|                                                               |\n|  ECOSYSTEM           LOW  ─────────────────────→ HIGH         |\n|  SERVICES                                                     |\n|                                                               |\n|  MECHANIZATION       EASY ─────────────────────→ HARDER       |\n|  TRACTABILITY                                                 |\n+---------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
