        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ROTATION TIMING                Circuit breaker pattern\n  Planting a different crop    → Break the feedback loop: pest builds up on Host A\n  next year                      → no host available next season → population crash\n  Pathogen can't overwinter    → The \"circuit breaker\" opens the pathogen cycle;\n  without host                   prevents cascade to failure state"
    },
